-- id: exp6955-reformulation-fixture
-  title: Exact optimization-reformulation mapping fixture
-  track: verification
-  priority: critical
-  agent_type: codex
-  model: gpt-5.6-sol
-  requires_gpu: false
-  max_turns: 30
-  estimated_wall_time_min: 180
-  per_unit_rows: true
-  milestone: 2026.09.609
-  deliverable: results/experiment_6955_reformulation_fixture.json
-  prompt: |
-    CONTEXT:
-    SOVER, arXiv:2609.00728, separates LLM-written semantic mappings from exact
-    certification. Carnot needs a small local fixture before any live model run.
-    This task uses Z3 and bounded exact enumeration. It does not depend on the
-    advisory V609 contract audit or on dReal.
-
-    Work at {project_root}. The execution date is {date}.
-
-    EXISTING CODE TO READ FIRST:
-    - {project_root}/CLAUDE.md, {project_root}/CODEX.md, and
-      {project_root}/research-program.md
-    - {project_root}/research-references.md
-    - {project_root}/python/carnot/constraints
-    - {project_root}/python/carnot/verification
-    - {project_root}/python/carnot/verify
-    - {project_root}/scripts/verdict_row_consistency_lint.py
-    - {project_root}/openspec/capabilities/verification/spec.md
-    - {project_root}/openspec/capabilities/research-reporting/spec.md
-
-    TASK:
-    Build a deterministic corpus of equivalent and hard non-equivalent bounded
-    optimization formulations. Freeze a canonical mapping schema and exact
-    witnesses for domain and objective-order preservation. Prove each row with
-    both Z3 and a separate bounded enumerator.
-
-    CONCRETE STEPS:
-    0. PRECONDITIONS: require Z3, exact rational arithmetic, deterministic seed
-       control, current constraint interfaces, and writable checkpoints. On
-       failure, write blocked_reformulation_fixture with gate_check_summary.
-    1. Add REQ-VERIFY-6955 and tests first. Cover variable renaming, affine
-       mapping, objective scale and sign, missing bounds, strictness changes,
-       infeasible domains, duplicate variables, and deterministic replay.
-    2. Generate exactly 120 pairs: 72 equivalent and 48 hard negatives across
-       bounded integer linear, Boolean-cardinality, and bounded piecewise-linear
-       families. Keep coefficients and domains small enough for enumeration.
-    3. Define a versioned JSON mapping schema for variable correspondence,
-       affine transforms, domain clauses, objective direction and scale, and
-       claimed relation. Reject extra or missing variables deterministically.
-    4. For each pair, store canonical mapping, source and target formulations,
-       feasibility witnesses, counterexamples for negatives, objective-order
-       witnesses, family, difficulty, and the single hard-negative edit.
-    5. Prove each row independently with Z3 and exhaustive bounded enumeration.
-       Require agreement. Quarantine unknown, timeout, or disagreement rows.
-    6. Freeze train, calibration, held-out, and prospective-family splits by
-       generator template. Prove no normalized or isomorphic pair crosses a
-       split.
-    7. Replay all 120 rows in a fresh process from serialized formulations.
-       Recompute hashes, labels, witnesses, mappings, and split membership.
-    8. Set reformulation_fixture_ready_score=1 only when all 120 rows, all three
-       families, both labels, all splits, and both exact authorities agree.
-    9. Run focused tests, Ruff, OpenSpec coverage, artifact-convention audit,
-       verdict-row consistency lint, docs audit, and root-clutter checks.
-    10. REQUIRED ARTIFACT FIELDS: field_principles with one scientific
-        principle per required field and reformulation_fixture_ready_score;
-        preconditions_checked; inference_substrate
-        (deterministic_z3_and_bounded_enumeration_fixture_no_llm); duration_s;
-        source_artifact_hashes; rows; pair_rows; formulation_rows; mapping_rows;
-        family_rows; label_rows; hard_negative_rows; feasibility_witness_rows;
-        objective_order_rows; z3_rows; enumeration_rows; authority_agreement_rows;
-        split_rows; isomorphism_rows; fresh_process_replay_rows;
-        corpus_checkpoint_path; random_seed; reproducibility_checksum;
-        reformulation_fixture_ready_score; gate_check_summary with failed check,
-        expected value, and observed value for any blocked verdict;
-        verifier_is_oracle (true for fixture conformance only); verdict_class
-        (positive | circular_positive | null | blocked | disqualified | partial,
-        with circular_positive required when the fixture conforms);
-        honest_verdict with a terminal prefix consistent with verdict_class.
-
-    Run command: cd {project_root} && .venv/bin/python scripts/experiments/experiment_6955_reformulation_fixture.py --date {date}
-    Do NOT push. Do NOT modify scripts/research_conductor.py.
-  prior_failures:
-    - experiment_id: exp6943-verifier-density-prefix-corpus
-      verdict: blocked_gate_check_failed
-      addressed_by: "This exact fixture is an ungated SOVER-style reformulation corpus with task-local Z3 and enumeration authorities; it does not depend on the failed V608 global contract score."
-      retire_if_same_verdict: true
