-- id: exp6956-three-family-reformulation-bank
-  title: Three-family SOTA reformulation mapping bank
-  track: generation
-  priority: critical
-  agent_type: claude
-  model: sonnet
-  requires_gpu: true
-  max_turns: 50
-  estimated_wall_time_min: 720
-  per_unit_rows: true
-  milestone: 2026.09.609
-  deliverable: results/experiment_6956_three_family_reformulation_bank.json
-  gated_on:
-    - upstream: exp6955-reformulation-fixture
-      artifact_field: reformulation_fixture_ready_score
-      op: '=='
-      value: 1
-  prompt: |
-    CONTEXT:
-    Exp6955 supplies an exact SOVER-style mapping fixture. Earlier planning and
-    relation proposal banks either gate-blocked or lacked a current complete
-    runtime receipt. This task uses a new optimization-reformulation schema, a
-    fixed 162-attempt budget, all three mandated GGUF families, and per-attempt
-    checkpoints. Exact labels stay sealed until all raw outputs are durable.
-
-    Work at {project_root}. The execution date is {date}.
-
-    EXISTING CODE TO READ FIRST:
-    - {project_root}/CLAUDE.md, {project_root}/CODEX.md, and
-      {project_root}/research-program.md
-    - {project_root}/results/experiment_6955_reformulation_fixture.json
-    - {project_root}/results/experiment_6718_sota_planning_proposal_bank.json
-    - {project_root}/scripts/experiment_template.py
-    - {project_root}/scripts/inference_sota_models.py
-    - {project_root}/python/carnot/task_runtime_receipts.py
-    - {project_root}/openspec/capabilities/verification/spec.md
-    - {project_root}/openspec/capabilities/research-reporting/spec.md
-
-    TASK:
-    Generate a frozen mapping-proposal bank for 18 held-out reformulation pairs.
-    Run three independent candidates per pair on all three mandated local GGUF
-    families. Preserve raw text, parse results, self-reports, tokens, and
-    failures before any exact checker reads the candidates.
-
-    CONCRETE STEPS:
-    0. PRECONDITIONS: require reformulation_fixture_ready_score=1, the fixture
-       checkpoint, all three cached GGUF files, successful llama.cpp vocab_only
-       probes, authenticated CUDA offload, disk space, and atomic per-attempt
-       recovery. On failure, write blocked_three_family_reformulation_bank with
-       gate_check_summary.
-    1. Add REQ-VERIFY-6956 and tests first. Cover resume without duplication,
-       malformed JSON, timeout, tokenizer mismatch, leaked labels, copied
-       candidates, process teardown, model hash drift, and aggregate mismatch.
-    2. Define MODEL_SPECS with unsloth/Qwen3.6-35B-A3B-GGUF,
-       unsloth/gemma-4-31B-it-GGUF, and
-       unsloth/gemma-4-26B-A4B-it-GGUF. Use cached_sota_pair or the current GGUF
-       resolver. Never call AutoTokenizer on a GGUF repository ID. Legacy small
-       models may run CPU smoke tests only and cannot enter headline rows.
-    3. Freeze the same 18 held-out pair IDs, K=3 prompt variants, seeds,
-       decoding settings, token caps, mapping schema, and prompt hashes. The
-       headline budget is exactly 162 attempted outputs.
-    4. Ask only for mapping JSON plus an optional confidence and short rationale.
-       Do not expose pair labels, canonical mappings, witnesses, solver output,
-       other candidates, or any later memory.
-    5. Load one model at a time. After each call, atomically checkpoint raw text,
-       token IDs, parse state, runtime receipt, latency, and failure reason.
-       Close the model and CUDA context before loading the next family.
-    6. Parse only after the raw row is durable. Record schema validity without
-       repairing the candidate. Do not run Z3 or enumeration in this task.
-    7. Keep every malformed, timed-out, duplicated, or empty output in the
-       denominator. Report parse rate, candidate diversity, confidence, and
-       candidate-group completeness by family and prompt variant.
-    8. Set reformulation_bank_complete_score=1 only when all 162 attempt keys
-       have terminal rows and all model lifecycle receipts close. Completion
-       does not require correct mappings or selectable headroom.
-    9. Run focused tests, Ruff, OpenSpec coverage, applicable live-model checks,
-       artifact-convention audit, verdict-row consistency lint, docs audit, and
-       root-clutter checks.
-    10. REQUIRED ARTIFACT FIELDS: field_principles with one scientific
-        principle per required field and reformulation_bank_complete_score;
-        preconditions_checked; inference_substrate
-        (task_owned_local_gguf_reformulation_mapping_generation); duration_s;
-        source_artifact_hashes; rows; model_specs; model_rows; pair_rows;
-        attempt_rows; prompt_variant_rows; candidate_group_rows; raw_output_rows;
-        parse_rows; schema_rows; confidence_rows; rationale_rows; diversity_rows;
-        hidden_label_isolation_rows; checkpoint_rows; model_lifecycle_rows;
-        task_runtime_receipt; random_seed; reproducibility_checksum;
-        reformulation_bank_complete_score; gate_check_summary with failed check,
-        expected value, and observed value for any blocked verdict;
-        verifier_is_oracle (false); verdict_class (positive |
-        circular_positive | null | blocked | disqualified | partial);
-        honest_verdict with a terminal prefix consistent with verdict_class.
-
-    Run command: cd {project_root} && .venv/bin/python scripts/experiments/experiment_6956_three_family_reformulation_bank.py --date {date}
-    Do NOT push. Do NOT modify scripts/research_conductor.py.
